{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268ZVZsoRNUE1793701383.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方打擊跨境白牌車，拘捕一名50歲、持雙程證內地男司機。</p><p></p><p>行動扣查一輛跨境七人車。警方早前在網絡巡查，發現有白牌車中介招攬乘客，警員「放蛇」電召七人車，要求從香港往惠州，對方開價1,500元人民幣，並需事先支付部分款項。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CAR-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267279PCAdre1793701468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警員今日展開行動，上車後拘捕該名內地男司機，他暫涉嫌非法載客取酬、違反逗留條件等被扣查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.590436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:20.136525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:43.373534+00:00","content_hash":"f24363311520e26e5583ddf96d1e1ecad7352dfff711bed2cb5a8eed87f1fc7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.590436+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}